"name": "Hub Group, Inc.",
"description": "Hub Group, Inc. engages in the provision of comprehensive transportation and logistics management services focused on reliability, visibility, and value for customers. It operates through the Intermodal and Transportation Solutions (ITS) and Logistics segments. The ITS segment includes intermodal and dedicated trucking. The Logistics segment focuses on full outsource logistics solutions, transportation management services, consolidation and fulfillment services, and final mile delivery services. The company was founded by Phillip C. Yeager in 1971 and is headquartered in Oak Brook, IL.",
